    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gemmiferous is a Match 3 roguelike inspired by the likes of 'Slay the Spire,' 'You Must Build a Boat,' and the classic game 'Bejeweled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the vast dungeons beneath your manor and uncover old, hidden treasures. But beware of the dark and long-forgotten horrors that also lurk in these dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507510/extras/69d73e45b174ab97cde0a11641e5dc09.poster.avif?t=1753992729\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507510/extras/69d73e45b174ab97cde0a11641e5dc09.webm?t=1753992729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507510/extras/69d73e45b174ab97cde0a11641e5dc09.mp4?t=1753992729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your way carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507510/extras/12b856b471ffd5c42e888b5218aa35ab.poster.avif?t=1753992729\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507510/extras/12b856b471ffd5c42e888b5218aa35ab.webm?t=1753992729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507510/extras/12b856b471ffd5c42e888b5218aa35ab.mp4?t=1753992729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect gems, coins, and materials, and use them to repair the manor and its surrounding village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507510/extras/e03a1d87109fec41d9f7e621df0315fb.poster.avif?t=1753992729\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507510/extras/e03a1d87109fec41d9f7e621df0315fb.webm?t=1753992729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507510/extras/e03a1d87109fec41d9f7e621df0315fb.mp4?t=1753992729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase various upgrades in the village shops, visit the tavern, and gamble all your hard-earned gems. Set up production of materials in the nearby forest, stone quarry, and iron mine. Decorate your village with the goal of making this place a new home for the people. Uncover all the mysteries of the manor and the village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507510/extras/914ecef9011b73f7ab2e6920f523d876.poster.avif?t=1753992729\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507510/extras/914ecef9011b73f7ab2e6920f523d876.webm?t=1753992729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507510/extras/914ecef9011b73f7ab2e6920f523d876.mp4?t=1753992729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 Playable Characters:</strong> As a lord, you will hire rogues to enter the dungeons for you, each offering a slightly different playstyle to keep the game fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>60+ Monsters:</strong> Create a wide variety of challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random Event Rooms:</strong> The game offers a wide variety of random event rooms, bringing some RNG luck to the game, inspired by <i>Darkest Dungeon</i> and <i>Slay the Spire.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Combat:</strong> In this game, you must think and match quickly in order to stay alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Weapons and Items:</strong> Spend coins and gems in the village shops to make your next run more successful.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Repair the Manor and Village:</strong> Repair the manor and village to gain access to many available facilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Houses and Decorate the Village:</strong> Build houses and decorate the village to increase your population.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gemmiferous is a Match 3 roguelike inspired by the likes of 'Slay the Spire,' 'You Must Build a Boat,' and the classic game 'Bejeweled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the vast dungeons beneath your manor and uncover old, hidden treasures. But beware of the dark and long-forgotten horrors that also lurk in these dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507510/extras/69d73e45b174ab97cde0a11641e5dc09.poster.avif?t=1753992729\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507510/extras/69d73e45b174ab97cde0a11641e5dc09.webm?t=1753992729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507510/extras/69d73e45b174ab97cde0a11641e5dc09.mp4?t=1753992729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your way carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507510/extras/12b856b471ffd5c42e888b5218aa35ab.poster.avif?t=1753992729\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507510/extras/12b856b471ffd5c42e888b5218aa35ab.webm?t=1753992729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507510/extras/12b856b471ffd5c42e888b5218aa35ab.mp4?t=1753992729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect gems, coins, and materials, and use them to repair the manor and its surrounding village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507510/extras/e03a1d87109fec41d9f7e621df0315fb.poster.avif?t=1753992729\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507510/extras/e03a1d87109fec41d9f7e621df0315fb.webm?t=1753992729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507510/extras/e03a1d87109fec41d9f7e621df0315fb.mp4?t=1753992729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase various upgrades in the village shops, visit the tavern, and gamble all your hard-earned gems. Set up production of materials in the nearby forest, stone quarry, and iron mine. Decorate your village with the goal of making this place a new home for the people. Uncover all the mysteries of the manor and the village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507510/extras/914ecef9011b73f7ab2e6920f523d876.poster.avif?t=1753992729\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507510/extras/914ecef9011b73f7ab2e6920f523d876.webm?t=1753992729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507510/extras/914ecef9011b73f7ab2e6920f523d876.mp4?t=1753992729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 Playable Characters:</strong> As a lord, you will hire rogues to enter the dungeons for you, each offering a slightly different playstyle to keep the game fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>60+ Monsters:</strong> Create a wide variety of challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random Event Rooms:</strong> The game offers a wide variety of random event rooms, bringing some RNG luck to the game, inspired by <i>Darkest Dungeon</i> and <i>Slay the Spire.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Combat:</strong> In this game, you must think and match quickly in order to stay alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Weapons and Items:</strong> Spend coins and gems in the village shops to make your next run more successful.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Repair the Manor and Village:</strong> Repair the manor and village to gain access to many available facilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Houses and Decorate the Village:</strong> Build houses and decorate the village to increase your population.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
